---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Noah B. Johnson | Engineering Lead"
  description="Noah B. Johnson is an engineering lead and hands-on systems architect in Madison, WI, building high-performing teams and resilient, scalable platforms."
>
  <div class="resume-container">
    <header class="header">
      <div class="header-content">
        <img class="headshot" src="/avatar.webp" alt="Illustrated portrait of Noah B. Johnson" width="150" height="150" />
        <div class="header-text">
          <h1>Noah B. Johnson</h1>
          <p class="subtitle">Engineering lead building high-performing teams and resilient, scalable platforms</p>
          <p class="location">Madison, Wisconsin, United States</p>
          <div class="contact-info">
            <a href="mailto:noah@noahbjohnson.net">noah@noahbjohnson.net</a>
            <span class="separator">•</span>
            <a href="tel:+19203269112">(920) 326-9112</a>
            <span class="separator">•</span>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/noahbjohnson" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
            <span class="separator">•</span>
            <a href="https://github.com/noahbjohnson" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
            <span class="separator">•</span>
            <a class="resume-link" href="/resume/resume.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Resume (PDF)</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Summary</h2>
      <p class="summary">Engineering lead and hands-on systems architect. At FORM I built much of the image recognition platform as an engineer and now lead it; it serves hundreds of the world's top brands and costs about half what it did when I joined. I grow engineers by giving them ownership of whole systems and guarding the focus that takes. I ship code through agentic engineering, and I created the harness and practices that made it the default across my team.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Experience</h2>

      <div class="job">
        <div class="job-header">
          <div>
            <h3>FORM</h3>
            <p class="tenure">Remote · Aug 2022 to present</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="role">
          <h4>Lead Software Engineer</h4>
          <p class="date">Apr 2026 to present</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Lead the team that owns FORM's image recognition platform, from public APIs through workflow orchestration and reporting, at a scale of ~25M images a month, producing ~250M tags and bounding boxes</li>
            <li>Oversaw the migration of image recognition orchestration to Temporal, which halved processing latency; the median is now ~10 seconds and every image finishes within 5 minutes</li>
            <li>Led my team's integration work through FORM's merger with Trax: brought Trax's image recognition into our pipeline, designed the API contracts between the two companies' systems and coordinated across business units to consolidate processing onto one architecture</li>
            <li>Built the team's Claude Code workspace of specialist agents, skills and shared practices</li>
            <li>Shape system design and architecture with our principal engineer and product partner, and run technical spikes to de-risk work before the team commits</li>
            <li>Take on high-impact projects outside the product roadmap, shipping full-stack solutions ahead of productization without pulling the team off its priorities; the latest, a planogram ingestion and product-matching tool, should save solutions and professional services teams thousands of hours</li>
            <li>Manage 6 direct reports across 1:1s, performance reviews and career development</li>
            <li>Doubled the team from 3 to 6; new hires ship to production within their first two weeks</li>
            <li>Partner with product and engineering leadership at the department and executive levels on planning, priorities and resourcing, and with customer success teams on new use cases</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="role">
          <h4>Senior Software Engineer</h4>
          <p class="date">Apr 2025 to Apr 2026</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Technical lead for the image recognition platform's architecture and roadmap; defined the service contracts between the ML, web, mobile and reporting teams that depend on it</li>
            <li>Architected and led delivery of IRaaS, FORM's external image recognition API, built for 100x traffic bursts; partnered with Google Cloud engineering to validate its scaling behavior at volume</li>
            <li>Designed a configurable orchestration layer and wrote the region-migration playbook on top of it, carrying processing through multiple regional degradations with no downtime</li>
            <li>Incident commander for most production incidents; unified GCP monitoring and PagerDuty alerting</li>
            <li>Championed company-wide Go standards; mentored, onboarded and interviewed engineers</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="role">
          <h4>Software Engineer</h4>
          <p class="date">Aug 2022 to Apr 2025</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Led the zero-downtime move from a homegrown orchestrator to Google Cloud Workflows, which became the foundation for the image recognition pipeline and IRaaS</li>
            <li>Wrote the Python data validation framework that compared outputs across the old and new pipelines to verify parity through the migration</li>
            <li>Designed the system of record for image recognition configs, inputs and model outputs alongside our principal engineer</li>
            <li>Migrated PhotoWorks, FORM's reporting app, from NoSQL to Postgres with zero data loss and zero downtime, not even a maintenance window</li>
            <li>Normalized the PhotoWorks domain model, making responses 5x faster for large enterprise customers</li>
            <li>Cut service downtime ~95% through architecture and stack upgrades, ending the multi-day PhotoWorks ingestion outages that were common when I joined</li>
            <li>Brought PhotoWorks ingest and operations costs down ~90%</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="job">
        <div class="job-header">
          <div>
            <h3>Kion</h3>
            <p class="tenure">Remote</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="role">
          <h4>GCP Software Engineer</h4>
          <p class="date">Sep 2020 to Jul 2022</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Built Google Cloud support into Kion's cloud governance product from scratch and owned it from architecture through customer escalations</li>
            <li>Wrote the microservices and internal SDKs behind it, and led company-wide education on GCP architecture and best practices</li>
            <li>Shipped full-stack features in Go and Angular</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Open Source</h2>
      <div class="job project">
        <h3><a href="https://github.com/genealogix/glx" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Genealogix (GLX)</a></h3>
        <p class="tenure">Creator and lead maintainer</p>
        <p>An open standard and Go CLI for collaborative, Git-native genealogy archives, designed to succeed GEDCOM: YAML records validated by JSON Schema, GEDCOM import and export, search, citations and a local viewer. Apache 2.0.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <div class="skills-grid">
        <div>
          <h4>Leadership</h4>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li>Engineering management</li>
            <li>Technical leadership</li>
            <li>People development</li>
            <li>Cross-functional leadership</li>
            <li>Incident command</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Engineering</h4>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li>Full-stack development</li>
            <li>Distributed systems and solution architecture</li>
            <li>API design</li>
            <li>Event-driven systems</li>
            <li>Observability</li>
            <li>AI agents and agentic engineering</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Stack</h4>
          <ul class="skill-list">
            <li>Go</li>
            <li>TypeScript</li>
            <li>JavaScript</li>
            <li>React</li>
            <li>Python</li>
            <li>SQL</li>
            <li>Google Cloud Platform</li>
            <li>Terraform</li>
            <li>Temporal</li>
            <li>PostgreSQL</li>
            <li>OpenSearch</li>
            <li>Apache Kafka</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <div class="education">
        <h3>Luther College</h3>
        <p>Data Science, Computer Science minor · 2015 to 2019</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .resume-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    background-color: #1a1a1a;
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  /* Header Section */
  .header {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 30px;
    border-bottom: 3px solid #4a9eff;
  }

  .header-content {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .headshot {
    width: 150px;
    height: 150px;
    min-width: 150px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(74, 158, 255, 0.3);
  }

  .header-text h1 {
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .subtitle {
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #a0aec0;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .location {
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    color: #718096;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .contact-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .contact-info a {
    color: #4a9eff;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .contact-info a:hover {
    color: #7b68ee;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .separator {
    color: #4a5568;
  }

  /* Section Styles */
  .section {
    margin-bottom: 35px;
  }

  .section h2 {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: #4a9eff;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #2d3748;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* Job Styles */
  .job {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    padding: 20px;
    background-color: #242424;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 3px solid #4a9eff;
    transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
  }

  .job:hover {
    transform: translateX(4px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(74, 158, 255, 0.1);
  }

  .job-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .job h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .tenure {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #718096;
    margin: 2px 0 0 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .role {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .role h4 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .date {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #718096;
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
  }

  .location-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #718096;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .description {
    margin: 8px 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #cbd5e0;
  }

  .job ul {
    margin: 8px 0 0 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  .job li {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #cbd5e0;
  }

  .job li::marker {
    color: #4a9eff;
  }

  /* Education */
  .education {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    padding: 15px;
    background-color: #242424;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .education h3 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .education p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #cbd5e0;
  }

  /* Skills Grid */
  .skills-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .skills-grid h4 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .skill-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .skill-list li {
    padding: 8px 12px;
    color: #cbd5e0;
    background-color: #242424;
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    transition: background-color 0.2s;
  }

  .skill-list li:hover {
    background-color: #2d3748;
  }

  .skill-list li:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .contact-info .resume-link {
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .project p {
    margin: 8px 0 0 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #cbd5e0;
  }

  .project a {
    color: #4a9eff;
  }

  .summary {
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Responsive Design */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .header-content {
      flex-direction: column;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .header-text h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .contact-info {
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .headshot {
      width: 120px;
      height: 120px;
      min-width: 120px;
    }

    .skills-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .job {
      padding: 15px;
    }
  }

  /* Global Styles */
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', 'Oxygen',
      'Ubuntu', 'Cantarell', 'Fira Sans', 'Droid Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    background-color: #0d0d0d;
    color: #cbd5e0;
  }
</style>
